1
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:51,842
He asks me: "Will you come with me?"
To play the songs of ecstasy?

2
00:00:54,037 --> 00:01:04,441
But I am scared to leave the place,
And change the safety for this space.

3
00:01:07,961 --> 00:01:15,274
The watchman is a house of light,
Don't let it turn to stone and night!

4
00:01:15,353 --> 00:01:22,630
But forty years have passed us by,
And now this empty grave will cry!

5
00:01:28,066 --> 00:01:38,482
We must make all these old walls shake,
For a cold world is now at stake.

6
00:01:40,412 --> 00:01:51,483
If we don't fill this place with fire,
It dies along with our desire.

7
00:01:55,669 --> 00:02:01,738
The watchman is a house of light,
Don't let it turn to stone and night!

8
00:02:01,845 --> 00:02:12,027
But forty years have passed us by,
And now this empty grave will cry!

9
00:02:20,804 --> 00:02:30,965
Today the doors are locked and cold,
The watchman's warmth was bought and sold.

10
00:02:33,206 --> 00:02:44,026
The demon sucked the spirit dry,
And left a dead shell in the sky.

11
00:02:48,215 --> 00:02:54,215
The watchman is a house of light,
Don't let it turn to stone and night!

12
00:02:54,371 --> 00:03:00,492
But forty years have passed us by,
And now this empty grave will cry!

13
00:03:00,527 --> 00:03:06,911
I stand alone and hear the sound,
Of silent stones upon the ground.

14
00:03:06,971 --> 00:03:13,004
The echo of our holy flame, 
Still whispers her sweet sacred name...

